01:37:08.000 --> 01:37:10.000
Pole aimugi.

01:37:17.000 --> 01:37:19.000
Pole aimugi.

01:37:20.000 --> 01:37:25.000
Mu maja on küll
indiaanlaste surnuaia kohal...

01:37:34.000 --> 01:37:37.000
Pole aimugi.

01:37:39.000 --> 01:37:44.000
Mu maja... Vabandust.
Ma teen selle ära.

01:37:47.000 --> 01:37:52.000
